      <h2 class="d-l" data-split>Four days at the festival, <span class="it">six days in the story</span></h2>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="lede">Leave your city, walk into Mood Indigo, IIT Bombay’s cultural festival since 1971</p>
        <p class="body muted">Students from thousands of colleges on one campus, a dance crew rehearsing in a corridor, a workshop you didn’t plan to attend, a night show that takes your voice and a dinner with people you met an hour ago</p>
        <p class="body muted">Pick the 6 day plan and the city gets you too, the Gateway, a ferry to Elephanta, sunset on Marine Drive, Bandra, Juhu and one last stop at Jio World Drive</p>
